        <div class="space-y-4">
          <p>FilWest is being built for adult Filipinas and Western partners who want to get to know one another with clear intentions. It is not a catalogue of women, a marriage broker or a promise that every match will become a relationship.</p>
          <p>Start with an honest profile, ask questions about everyday life and take enough time to see whether words and actions remain consistent. Family, faith, distance, work and future plans deserve real conversations rather than assumptions about Filipino culture.</p>
