          <p>Online dating still requires judgement. A badge, photo or video call can provide information, but none guarantees another person’s identity, character or intentions. Keep personal and financial boundaries, use reporting controls when needed and plan early meetings in public.</p>
          <p>Before creating an account, read our <a href="/safety" class="text-coral underline underline-offset-4 font-semibold">dating safety guidance</a> and check our current <a href="/pricing" class="text-coral underline underline-offset-4 font-semibold">access information</a>. Our <a href="/guides" class="text-coral underline underline-offset-4 font-semibold">Filipino-Western dating guides</a> cover messaging, video calls, culture, long-distance relationships and meeting in the Philippines.</p>
